flowchart TD
  A["Action fails or external state contradicts prediction"] --> B["Capture evidence and action receipt"]
  B --> C["Independent verification"]
  C --> D["Izanami: classify recurrence and progress"]
  D -->|Justified retry with new evidence| E["Revise hypothesis and retry within budget"]
  D -->|Stagnation / oscillation / invariant violation| F["Pause side effects"]
  F --> G["Izanagi: inspect last verified state"]
  G --> H{"Safe checkpoint available?"}
  H -->|yes| I["Restore or compensate"]
  H -->|no| J["Reconstruct plan from current reality"]
  I --> K["Independent post-recovery verification"]
  J --> K
  K --> L{"Verified safe state?"}
  L -->|yes| M["Replan with changed hypothesis"]
  L -->|no| N["Human escalation or safe stop"]
